Package: neutr
Title: Inference and Fast Generation of Neutral Species Assemblages
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Jerome", "Chave", , "jerome.chave@cnrs.fr", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Maximum likelihood estimation of the parameters of four neutral
    models of species assemblages (the Ewens model, the Etienne model of a local
    community with dispersal limitation, the multideme model and the Pitman
    model), and fast, exact generation of typical species abundance
    distributions of the Ewens and Pitman models given their parameters.
    Calculations scale to very large samples, on the order of 10^12 individuals,
    except for the Etienne model, whose likelihood is practical up to about 10^5
    individuals.
License: GPL-3
URL: https://github.com/jeromechave/neutr
